(
    title: "Dancing Plate",
    description: Some("A circus plate-spinning act: plates appear one by one atop tall wands and gradually wobble, and you steer the juggler beneath the shakiest pole, hammering the button to spin its plate back into balance — or dashing to catch one that falls. Scoring is survival time, a spare plate is earned every 10,000 points, and each shattered plate costs one; eight selectable variations change the act."),
